# FINAL DEFINITION OF SUCCESS

ClearPath AI should now support a complete, coherent journey:

A person enters Recover & Rebuild.

They explain their situation and identify the substance or substances they are concerned about.

The system understands their stated preferences, checks immediate safety and presents appropriate support pathways.

The person chooses the assistance they want.

Where professional care is needed or desired, ClearPath helps connect them with a verified professional.

The user controls which information is shared.

The therapist can review the authorized information, provide feedback, assign appropriate activities and follow the person's submitted progress.

ClearPath helps organize the journey between professional appointments and supports meaningful everyday rebuilding.

The other three public roles continue operating independently and effectively.

The platform's defining innovation is its ability to connect personal needs, evidence-informed support, verified human assistance and continuing care through one coherent and user-controlled system.

**Do not merely create these screens. Implement and test their actual functionality in my existing ClearPath AI application.**